---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator or projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_end: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: already ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert AlreadyEnded
    q_end --> q_set_refund: hasEnded = true, endTime = now
    q_set_refund --> [*]: refundEndTime = now + refundPeriodSeconds, emit SaleEnded

    note right of q_end
        INV-001: sale can be ended by either Legion operator or projectAdmin
        INV-002: refund period starts immediately after sale ends
        INV-003: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds
        INV-004: no further investments accepted after end
    end note
